DESCRIPTION:Enjoy great stand-up comedy in downtown DC! Our showcase lineup
 s feature top talent from DC\, Maryland\, Virginia and beyond\, performing 
 on one of the country's most famous stages. You'll see a variety of styles 
 and get up close with some of the stars of tomorrow. Support local talent\,
  support local business and (most important) laugh your a** off. Showcases 
 generally last around 90 minutes.\n\nJanuary 1-3: Sandi Benton\, Matt Brown
 \, Aminah Imani\, Naomi Karavani\n\nAll sales are final. Refunds and exchan
 ges are offered only when a show is canceled or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission P
 olicies\n\nPatrons must be 18 or older to attend events or classes at the D
 C Improv. Any exceptions are clearly noted in the event descriptions.\n\nTh
 ere is a two-item minimum per customer. This can be any combination of food
  items or beverages. Bottled water and soft drinks count as items. (The two
 -item minimum does not apply to comedy classes.)\n\nCoupons or passes for f
 ree admission cannot be used for a show listed as a "special event."\n\nSea
 ting Policies\n\nShows in our lounge showroom are seated by time of arrival
 . The earlier you arrive\, the more options you'll have. Please note that t
 he size of your party can affect what options are available to you\, as cer
 tain tables and areas are designated for larger parties. If your party does
  not fill an entire table\, you may be sharing a table with other patrons.\
 nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/stand-up-showcase-91
 528/
